#53502
"Pig Pasture"
"Short yellowish green grass pokes up determinedly from the dry, packed earth.

A hill rises up sharply to the north and another to the southeast.  A narrow

path cuts between them, winding east.  This dry little valley spreads south

and west and looks fairly round.  An unpleasant odor, caused from scattered

animal droppings, is thinned by a breeze from the west.

"
"[Elfir] Pig Pasture starts

